  "id": "ex-07-verben-praepositionen-b1",
  "intro": "Standalone drill set, not tied to any lesson. Builds on the A2 set with more fixed-preposition verbs — including ones that take a Dativ preposition (Angst haben VOR, träumen VON) rather than Akkusativ — and the matching da(r)-/wo(r)- compounds: wovor/davor, wovon/davon, alongside worüber/darüber and wofür/dafür from before. The rule is the same regardless of case: a compound only replaces a THING, never a person. Blocks: A Basistraining → B Vertiefung → C Sprachbausteine → D Wiederholung. Answers in solutions.md.\n",
  "lesson": "EX/07-verben-praepositionen-b1",
  "level": "B1",
